=================== Business Rules ===================
A. Student Business Rules
ID	    Business Rule	                                                            Status
BR-01	Only existing students may be enrolled	                                    Agreed
BR-02	Only ACTIVE students may create new enrollment requests	                    Agreed
BR-03	Only ACTIVE students are eligible for enrollment confirmation	            Agreed
BR-04	Deactivating a student cancels their PENDING enrollments	                Agreed
BR-05	Deactivating a student does not cancel their CONFIRMED enrollments	        Agreed
BR-06	Reactivating a student does not restore previously cancelled enrollments	Agreed

B. Course Business Rules
ID	     Business Rule	                                                           Status
BR-07	Course must exist before enrollment	                                       Agreed
BR-08	Only ACTIVE courses accept enrollment requests	                           Agreed
BR-09	Only ACTIVE courses allow pending enrollment confirmation	               Agreed
BR-10	Course capacity must be greater than zero	                               Proposed
BR-11	Capacity cannot be reduced below the number of confirmed enrollments	   Proposed
BR-12	Archived courses cannot accept new registrations	                       Agreed
BR-13	Archiving a course preserves its confirmed enrollment history	           Proposed
BR-14	Archiving a course cancels its pending enrollment requests	               Proposed

C. Enrollment Business Rules
ID	    Business Rule	                                                           Status
BR-15	Enrollment must reference an existing student and course	               Agreed
BR-16	New enrollment requests start as PENDING	                               Agreed
BR-17	Pending enrollments do not reserve seats	                               Agreed
BR-18	Only CONFIRMED enrollments consume capacity	                               Agreed
BR-19	Confirmed enrollments must never exceed course capacity                    Agreed
BR-20	A student cannot have two active enrollments in the same course	           Agreed
BR-21	Cancelled enrollments remain in history	                                   Agreed
BR-22	Cancelled enrollments cannot be reactivated	                               Agreed
BR-23	A student may create a new enrollment after cancellation, if eligible	   Agreed
BR-24	Only a PENDING enrollment can transition to CONFIRMED	                   Agreed
BR-25	PENDING and CONFIRMED enrollments can transition to CANCELLED	           Agreed

D. FIFO & Automatic Confirmation Rules
ID	    Business Rule	                                                                                      Status
BR-26	Eligible pending requests are processed oldest first	                                              Agreed
BR-27	Ineligible requests must not block eligible requests behind them	                                  Agreed
BR-28	Cancelling a CONFIRMED enrollment triggers automatic promotion when eligible pending requests exist	  Agreed
BR-29	Cancelling a PENDING enrollment does not release a reserved seat	                                  Agreed
BR-30	Tied request timestamps use a deterministic ordering rule	                                          Proposed
BR-31	Promotion must not violate student, course or capacity rules	                                      Agreed
