=================== 10. Acceptance Criteria  ===================
AC-01 — Successful Enrollment Request
   Given an ACTIVE student
   And an ACTIVE course
   And no active enrollment for this student in this course

   When the staff requests enrollment

   Then a new PENDING enrollment is created
AC-02 — Duplicate Enrollment Rejection
   Given a student with an existing PENDING enrollment
   And the same course

   When the staff requests another enrollment

   Then the request is rejected
   And no duplicate enrollment is created
AC-03 — Automatic Promotion
   Given a course at full capacity
   And eligible pending enrollments
   And the oldest eligible request belongs to Sara

   When a CONFIRMED enrollment is cancelled

   Then the cancelled enrollment becomes CANCELLED
   And Sara's enrollment becomes CONFIRMED
   And the confirmed count does not exceed capacity
AC-04 — Student Deactivation
   Given an ACTIVE student
   And one CONFIRMED enrollment
   And one PENDING enrollment

   When the student is deactivated

   Then the student becomes INACTIVE
   And the PENDING enrollment becomes CANCELLED
   And the CONFIRMED enrollment remains unchanged
